"""py2cpp 集成测试包（``scripts/build_all.bat`` 递归 ``tests/**/test_*.paw``）。

目录与 ``paw/<域>/`` 对齐：``tests/<域>/test_<模块>.paw`` 对应 ``paw/<域>/<模块>.paw``；
子包同理（如 ``tests/io/test_path.paw`` ↔ ``paw/io/path.paw``）。

| 目录 | 对应标准库 |
|------|------------|
| ``text/`` | ``paw/text/`` |
| ``util/`` | ``paw/util/``（含 ``Pool``、``misc``） |
| ``io/`` | ``paw/io/``（``test_io.paw``） |
| ``io/`` | ``paw/io/``、``paw/io/path.paw`` |
| ``system/`` | ``paw/system/``（``time``、``datetime``） |
| ``serde/`` | ``paw/serde/`` |
| ``core/`` | ``paw/core/`` |
| ``design/`` | ``paw/design/`` |
| ``alg/`` | ``paw/alg/`` |
| ``math/`` | ``paw/math/`` |
| ``numeric/`` | ``paw/numeric/`` |
| ``ui/`` | ``paw/ui/`` |
| ``concur/`` | ``paw/concur/`` |
| ``misc/`` | 内建冒烟、字面量查表、全局 ``pow`` 等 |
| ``lang/`` | 语言特性 |
| ``import_tests/`` | ``import`` / 模块命名空间 |
| ``perf/`` | 性能基准（默认不进 ``build_all.bat``） |
| ``fail/`` | 负向编译（``build_fail.bat``） |
"""
from paw import *
